ocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:210:370:sha256-615c651d3b77c0f73dc1b570db8afa27e4e440edc5aa00caf57180a91c60f03d\",\"quote\":\"(2) The infant's head may be discreetly supported, e.g., a car seat with a white or off-white blanket behind the child. Head tilt is acceptable for infants; and\",\"start\":210},{\"end\":235,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:232:235:sha256-ee4d988c65de860fabbfbcd27f73d50bbebe3fba37fe419284f4811389c30bdc\",\"quote\":\"may\",\"start\":232},{\"end\":370,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:210:370:sha256-615c651d3b77c0f73dc1b570db8afa27e4e440edc5aa00caf57180a91c60f03d\",\"quote\":\"(2) The infant's head may be discreetly supported, e.g., a car seat with a white or off-white blanket behind the child. Head tilt is acceptable for infants; and\",\"start\":210},{\"end\":102,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:0:102:sha256-d5352952c35d27ead43ba84f11e560e73e7604cc8f5e1991855c69f726f1417f\",\"quote\":\"d. Infants pose a particular challenge. The goal is the best likeness that can reasonably be obtained:\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":370,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:210:370:sha256-615c651d3b77c0f73dc1b570db8afa27e4e440edc5aa00caf57180a91c60f03d\",\"quote\":\"(2) The infant's head may be discreetly supported, e.g., a car seat with a white or off-white blanket behind the child. Head tilt is acceptable for infants; and\",\"start\":210}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:e940cf36519e8c491961f9ceef4bb4fae274c8bb904c8e0fb2c1df65ee44919d\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"logic_text\":\"(2) The infant's head may be discreetly supported, e.g., a car seat with a white or off-white blanket behind the child. Head tilt is acceptable for infants; and\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:caea1e717be06d95b4897281c405696db4d2278f4959c13bfe014fb05170fad3\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"modality_quote\":\"may\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:4b30b38eeb144c952406157815483ca315484bc64804a5d583987952e22d5a47\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(2) The infant's head may be discreetly supported, e.g., a car seat with a white or off-white blanket behind the child. Head tilt is acceptable for infants; and\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:ed2d64545627699f9a32784f377531a85285d16f54f045a21bd7340fdc91817f\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"d. Infants pose a particular challenge. The goal is the best likeness that can reasonably be obtained:\"],\"scope_text\":\"When photographing an infant:\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":210,\"summary\":\"The infant's head may be discreetly supported (for example, using a car seat with a white or off-white blanket behind the child).\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
