photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"start\":579},{\"end\":604,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:598:604:sha256-f86b1f62a8554232b940f4fd9c8d6601aae4767456df3d6cdff55a51f17b5075\",\"quote\":\"should\",\"start\":598},{\"end\":539,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:436:539:sha256-7f0fa99d97951a139f33ec44a19b323846e2dfb0edb6a59ea10b8060a5799c86\",\"quote\":\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\",\"start\":436}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:6ce2c21e0ccd7dd41c49f412b26d5594b1ab8818b37b9542d04651caa8f81980\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"recommendation\",\"logic_text\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:fa4bb57a708c200a4ffef492ce15b9a2d3868ac0c5b7cb145075a2e611852437\",\"modality\":\"should\",\"modality_quote\":\"should\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:7b9b2c673f319d26a0ca01b6bc8be4664bdb4526e322bf1f1323aacab15209fc\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"references\":[\"22 CFR 51.26\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:eefa0adae30852a4b98840d23745955497a4dc26e3623ec0b64f90c262719414\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\"],\"scope_text\":\"For a submitted photograph:\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":579,\"summary\":\"The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of, and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26).\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
